# TODO

- Dedupe the weight report fetch: `weight-report` and `weight-chart` both call
  `WeightReportService.loadWeightReport()` on init, and all carousel pages mount
  at startup, so the app issues two `GET /api/report` calls on load. Harmless but
  wasteful. Simplest fix is an in-flight guard in the service (skip if a request
  is already running). See weight-chart-plan.md.


- review create-tables.sql script and remove if uneeded

